    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies {@link TokenQueue#escapeCssIdentifier(String)} against the CSSOM \"serialize an identifier\" algorithm (https://www.w3.org/TR/cssom-1/#serialize-an-identifier). <p>Each test case is a pair {@code (expected, input)}: the {@code input} identifier is escaped and compared to the {@code expected} serialized form. Non-printable and special characters are written as {@code \\\\uXXXX} unicode escapes so the exact code points under test stay explicit.</p>"
   },
